(7727769, 1272056, 103142, '<td valign="top">I was having Internet problems all week and it wasnt able to load the pictures. And so when things finally loaded only had time for about 1/3-1/2 of naming. I went through quick and named ones that came to me. I love this one, but I put it aside until later because it seemed like it needed the perfect name. And I couldnt think of one. Its such a wonderful group and theres such a story here. All I could keep thinking though, is the second guy from the left reminded me of Walter Matthau. Its the nose and the smile. But the other guy doesnt look like Jack Lemon. Huge congrats on the finish! Such a wonderful, feeling photo</td>', 'I was having Internet problems all week and it wasnt able to load the pictures. And so when things finally loaded only had time for about 1/3-1/2 of naming. I went through quick and named ones that came to me. I love this one, but I put it aside until later because it seemed like it needed the perfect name. And I couldnt think of one. Its such a wonderful group and theres such a story here. All I could keep thinking though, is the second guy from the left reminded me of Walter Matthau. Its the nose and the smile. But the other guy doesnt look like Jack Lemon. Huge congrats on the finish! Such a wonderful, feeling photo', '2022-08-12 10:08:07.000000', NULL, 0),
