(7727809, 1271983, 105869, '<td valign="top">Hi everybody, thank you all for your nice comments! I have no idea, which title is the best, all are to point!</td>', 'Hi everybody, thank you all for your nice comments! I have no idea, which title is the best, all are to point!', '2022-08-12 19:57:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(7727818, 1272056, 114285, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by vawendy:</b></div><hr/><i> I was having Internet problems all week and it wasnt able to load the pictures. And so when things finally loaded only had time for about 1/3-1/2 of naming. I went through quick and named ones that came to me. I love this one, but I put it aside until later because it seemed like it needed the perfect name. And I couldnt think of one. Its such a wonderful group and theres such a story here. All I could keep thinking though, is the second guy from the left reminded me of Walter Matthau. Its the nose and the smile. But the other guy doesnt look like Jack Lemon. Huge congrats on the finish! Such a wonderful, feeling photo </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Totally agree with the Walter Matthau resemblance!<br/>Thanks for the nice comment.</td>', 'Originally posted by vawendy: I was having Internet problems all week and it wasnt able to load the pictures. And so when things finally loaded only had time for about 1/3-1/2 of naming. I went through quick and named ones that came to me. I love this one, but I put it aside until later because it seemed like it needed the perfect name. And I couldnt think of one. Its such a wonderful group and theres such a story here. All I could keep thinking though, is the second guy from the left reminded me of Walter Matthau. Its the nose and the smile. But the other guy doesnt look like Jack Lemon. Huge congrats on the finish! Such a wonderful, feeling photo   Totally agree with the Walter Matthau resemblance!Thanks for the nice comment.', '2022-08-13 07:58:44.000000', NULL, 0),
